binets suggests an association with hiding or cabinet-related activities"\n    ]\n}\n```'}, {'role': 'system', 'content': '📋 CRITIC FEEDBACK (Confidence: 50%)'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '{\n    "tool": "VLM_QUERY",\n    "frames": ["frames/frame_1590.jpg", "frames/frame_1591.jpg", "frames/frame_1592.jpg", "frames/frame_1593.jpg", "frames/frame_1594.jpg", "frames/frame_1595.jpg", "frames/frame_1596.jpg", "frames/frame_1597.jpg", "frames/frame_1598.jpg", "frames/frame_1599.jpg", "frames/frame_1600.jpg", "frames/frame_1601.jpg", "frames/frame_1602.jpg", "frames/frame_1603.jpg", "frames/frame_1604.jpg", "frames/frame_1605.jpg", "frames/frame_1855.jpg", "frames/frame_1856.jpg", "frames/frame_1857.jpg", "frames/frame_1858.jpg", "frames/frame_1859.jpg", "frames/frame_1860.jpg", "frames/frame_1861.jpg", "frames/frame_1862.jpg", "frames/frame_1863.jpg", "frames/frame_1864.jpg", "frames/frame_1865.jpg", "frames/frame_1866.jpg", "frames/frame_1867.jpg", "frames/frame_1868.jpg", "frames/frame_1869.jpg", "frames/frame_1870.jpg", "frames/frame_1871.jpg", "frames/frame_1872.jpg", "frames/frame_1873.jpg", "frames/frame_1874.jpg", "frames/frame_1875.jpg", "frames/frame_1876.jpg", "frames/frame_1877.jpg", "frames/frame_1878.jpg", "frames/frame_1879.jpg", "frames/frame_1880.jpg"],\n    "prompt": "Analyze these frames to verify if answer \'0\' (Hide in the cabinet) is correct for \'What does the vampire do when the girl first finds him?\'. Check: 1) Is a vampire character present? 2) Is a girl character present? 3) Is there interaction between them? 4) What action does the vampire perform when discovered? 5) What is the setting/location? 6) What is the vampire\'s initial reaction? Pay close attention to temporal sequence and whether the vampire is hiding in a cabinet when first discovered by the girl."\n}'}, {'role': 'vlm response', 'content': {'batched_responses': [{'batch_start': 0, 'batch_end': 30, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/HfEVEGf1A8Q/frames/fr